     /// Topological (graph) distance matrix — N×N shortest-path distances.
     ///
-    /// Returns a list of N lists of N integers (atom graph distances).
-    /// Equivalent to RDKit's ``rdmolops.GetDistanceMatrix(mol)``.
-    ///
